        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;Emotional tone relates to pathos, the main argument is the purpose of the message, and credentials relate to ethos. In writing, the channel is the medium or format chosen to deliver the message—such as an email, a social media post, a business report, or a speech—and this choice affects how the audience receives the message.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
