      <itemfeedback ident="65161_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;Relationship-building before business describes Brazilian communication, storytelling and narrative describe Kenyan and West African traditions, and indirect communication that builds gradually describes Japanese communication style. German rhetorical style places high value on directness, thoroughness, and expertise—persuasive messages typically begin with credentials and detailed information before presenting conclusions.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
